      "impact": "UART3 will not function as intended, and routing the MCU's internal VCAP outputs to the connector without their required capacitors may prevent reliable MCU operation.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    },
    {
      "category": "open_connection",
      "components": ["HSE1", "HSE2", "FCC1", "NAVC1", "R23", "R32"],
      "pins": ["FCC1.5", "FCC1.37", "FCC1.12", "FCC1.13", "NAVC1.5", "NAVC1.6"],
      "nets": ["HSE_IN_FCC", "HSE_OUT_FCC", "HSE_IN_NAVC", "HSE_OUT_NAVC", "Net-(FCC1-PH0)", "VREF+_FCC", "Net-(NAVC1-PH0)", "Net-(NAVC1-PH1)"],
      "observed": "The FCC crystal network connects to FCC1 PE6/PE7 (pins 5/37), not its PH0/PH1 oscillator pins (pins 12/13). The NAVC crystal nets have no NAVC1 pins on them; NAVC1 PH0/PH1 instead each connect to a capacitor-to-ground net.",
      "expected": "Each MCU's 25 MHz crystal network should connect to that MCU's HSE oscillator pins. The specification identifies a 25 MHz HSE crystal for both MCUs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"31\") (name \"HSE_IN_FCC\") (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"PE6\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"33\") (name \"HSE_OUT_FCC\") (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"37\") (pinfunction \"PE7\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"32\") (name \"HSE_IN_NAVC\") (node (ref \"HSE2\") (pin \"1\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"90\") (name \"Net-(NAVC1-PH0)\") (node (ref \"NAVC1\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"PH0\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs) | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Neither MCU is correctly connected to its external high-speed crystal, so operation at the intended clock source will fail or require an unintended clock configuration.",
      "confidence": 0.98
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomalies are present: both MCUs have unconnected VDD pins, the FCC's UART3 connector is wired to VCAP pins, and the HSE crystal networks are misconnected or isolated from the MCU oscillator pins."
}

